{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>At mealtime.</b> Because of the heat." "<b>and she had left.</b> Because it is the end of the verse, like <i>זכור מלחמה אל תוסף</i> (do not add).'" "<b>And he handed.</b> It has no parallel, and its meaning is like giving."], :book :ruth, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {2 "Ibn Ezra's comment on ויצבט (vayyitsbot) notes the verb is a hapax legomenon; 'no parallel' renders אין לו חבר literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ruth -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ruth"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:27.354355579Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}